{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260627_122600_p12_b26", "persona_id": "db:12", "outcome": "DEAL_DONE", "content": "1. 价格锚定要选客户高频、低价的日常消费（如泰奶），并反复强化，但同一话术最多用2次，之后换角度（如'每天省一杯奶茶钱'）。", "difficulty_rating": 3, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260627_123156"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260627_122600_p12_b26", "persona_id": "db:12", "outcome": "DEAL_DONE", "content": "2. 客户提出具体疑虑时，立即安排现场演示，用数字和视觉结果回应，比口头解释有效10倍。", "difficulty_rating": 3, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260627_123156"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260627_122600_p12_b26", "persona_id": "db:12", "outcome": "DEAL_DONE", "content": "3. 客户上手体验后，至少等待2-3轮正面反馈再推进开单，避免过早催促。", "difficulty_rating": 3, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260627_123156"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260627_122600_p12_b26", "persona_id": "db:12", "outcome": "DEAL_DONE", "content": "4. 线下场景中，全程保持'递笔/递样机/指屏幕'等动作，让客户多感官参与。", "difficulty_rating": 3, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260627_123156"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260627_122600_p12_b26", "persona_id": "db:12", "outcome": "DEAL_DONE", "content": "5. 对于充电速度等参数，应提前准备官方数据或现场实测，避免凭记忆回答。", "difficulty_rating": 3, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260627_123156"}
{"type": "reusable_tactic", "session_id": "session_20260627_122600_p12_b26", "persona_id": "db:12", "outcome": "DEAL_DONE", "name": "价格锚定换算法", "condition": "客户对价格有疑虑时，且产品有分期选项。", "example": "将月付金额与客户日常高频低价消费（如奶茶、咖啡）对比，如'每天少喝一杯奶茶，就能拥有'。", "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260627_123156"}
